        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 76041, Fleur De Lis 24 Inch Wrought Steel Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Fleur De Lis Door Pull is a wonderful example of historically styled door hardware. The Fleur De Lis design was originally made popular by Louis VII, but now it is iconic of New Orleans. This Fleur De Lis 24 Inch Wrought Steel Door Handle is available with either a flat black steel or satin steel finish. Both of these finishes have a rough texture to mimic that found on naturally weathered metal for an old world look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/18-inch-fleur-de-lis-door-pull-emtek-76029\"><b>Fleur De Lis 18 Inch Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Fleur De Lis 24 Inch Wrought Steel Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 21-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with #10, 1” Wood Screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with surface mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Wrought-Steel-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"351\" height=\"184\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
